{"parents": [], "prev": null, "next": {"link": "core/", "title": "Core API"}, "title": "Reckon Python API", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"reckon-python-api\">\n<h1>Reckon Python API<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#reckon-python-api\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>This reference reads the core and memory API\u2019s signatures and docstrings from\nthe selected checkout. The Python package requires its compiled Rust extension;\nthe build does not substitute mock types for a missing extension.</p>\n<p>Use the authored laboratory manual for worked integrations, experiment design\nand interpretation. A supplied score, interface or threshold does not establish\nthat an intervention ran or identified a causal effect.</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"core/\">Core API</a><ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"core/#module-reckon.core.resources\">Resources</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"core/#module-reckon.core.channels\">Channels</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"core/#module-reckon.core.causality\">Recorded influence</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"core/#module-reckon.core.credit\">Credit and utility</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"core/#module-reckon.core.episode_context\">Episode context</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"memory/\">Memory API</a><ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"memory/#module-reckon.memory.manager\">Manager</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"memory/#module-reckon.memory.record\">Record values</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"memory/#module-reckon.memory.policies\">Retention policies</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["core", "Core API", "N", "next"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Reckon Python API</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "has_maths_elements": false, "current_page_name": "index", "sidebars": ["about.html", "searchfield.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0]}